# Repository-wide ignores.
#
# Only patterns without an internal separator belong here: those match at any
# depth, so they cover both pkg-r/ and pkg-py/. Package-relative patterns live
# in the package's own .gitignore (see pkg-r/.gitignore).
.Rproj.user
.Rprofile
plans/
docs
rsconnect/
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.override.md
.shinychat/
commons-reviews/
.worktrees/
/sandbox/commons-openai-citation-smoke/
.kata.local.toml
